# Create an inference key at https://console.thesys.dev/keys.
# Configure THESYS_API_KEY privately in .env.local to enable OpenUI Gateway generation.
# Optional: set OPENUI_MODEL to a supported provider/model identifier.
# Default model: openai/gpt-5.5
# Optional: DEMO_USER_ID and APP_ID set the Gateway identity for stored threads.
# Defaults: demo-user and shopping-assistant-cookbook.
# Optional: SHOPIFY_STORE is the store's domain, such as your-store.myshopify.com.
# Default: openui.myshopify.com, OpenUI's demo store.
